                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Mary Gaskell was married to <persName key="GAS01">Daniel Gaskell</persName>, Liberal MP for Wakefield 1832-7. 
      <persName key="GAS02">Mary Gaskell</persName> met <persName key="CLA03">Claire Clairmont</persName> in Pisa and Clairmont introduced her to 
      <persName key="SHE02">Mary Shelley</persName> by letter. The Gaskells were already admirers of Godwin's philosophy and they were keen to meet him.</p>
                    </note>
